  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by virtue of its excessive depth, height and proximity to the site boundary, would give rise to an unneighbourly and overly dominant form of development which would result in an unacceptable additional loss of sunlight, daylight and outlook, as perceived from the neighbouring property at No. 20 Broadgates Avenue, and would result in an unacceptably heightened sense of enclosure. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies  DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed development, by virtue of the proposed increase in roof height, would appear visually intrusive, incongruous, and overly dominant in relation to the immediately neighbouring propoerties. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), Policies DMD13 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), and Policy HW-1 of the Hadley Wood Neighbourhood Plan (2023)."
  ],
